  "findings": [
    "Config 2:5 opcode 0x15 contains typed item IDs and ushort quantities; blanket shop-stock-unavailable claim is disproven.",
    "All 957 inventory definitions decoded completely; 544 include 6,329 encoded stock rows, including 784 zero-stock entries.",
    "Inventory definitions themselves expose no shop name, currency, membership, keeper or location field.",
    "Six externally witnessed shop inventories match every dated Wiki name/stock row; all six availability name sets already agree with retained shopItems.",
    "Bob stock candidate disagrees with Wiki for two mithril throwing-axe quantities 8 versus 4 and is excluded from runtime.",
    "No complete all-live-shop coverage is certified; same-name inventories, split free inventories, reward UIs and unused configs remain possible."
  ],
  "comparisonLimits": [
    "404 retained shops and 576 chunk/section declarations are enumerated exhaustively; 226 have exact cache name-set candidates, 187 unique and 39 ambiguous. These are not identity proof.",
    "47 retained shops have no item-name overlap. No additions/removals are certified for unreviewed identities.",
    "No shop location additions/removals or rename pairs are established; retained Zaff label already uses current title.",
    "Retained shopItems contains availability flags, so it supplies no stock quantities for numerical comparison."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Copied snapshot freshness and inferred schema build 950 are not independent current-game build validation.",
    "Base stocks/caps do not establish live remaining stock, price, restock schedule, personal limits or active server inventories.",
    "Wiki owner/membership are external metadata; NPC definition inventory params are absent and keeper links remain unknown.",
    "Item membership flags do not certify shop/world access; Beefy Jug of water pack has explicit Wiki members-only row.",
    "120 reward UI struct fragments retain title/currency text and enum/item references, without base-stock or server execution assertions.",
    "Interface schema has four explicit failures; obfuscated clientscript instructions remain unavailable. ASCII spans and headers are only search evidence."
  ],
